# Store the ORIGINAL trajectory before trajectory_server_node delays its
# operation_start_utc because it must wait for an already-active lower-priority
# trajectory.
#
# The complete StaticTrajectory is preserved, including:
#   takeoff
#   mission[]
#   landing
#
# No geometry is modified and no extra_time is computed by this service.
static_trajectory_manager/StaticTrajectory trajectory
---
bool accepted
string message
